  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "📗 dsh-extension-workbook",
      "text": "**高保真、fail-closed 的 Excel XLSX/XLSM 工作簿检视、读取、渲染、编辑、比对与验证工具 —— 移植自 @firstpick/pi-extension-workbook**\n\n[中文](#中文) · [English](#english)\n\n</div>\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "中文",
      "text": "**在 DeepSeek Harness 里安全地检视、渲染、编辑与验证 Excel 工作簿：不执行宏、不刷新外部链接、所有写入都有 SHA-256 冲突保护与 dry-run 先行，任何不支持或可能有损的操作一律 fail-closed。**"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 检视 `.xlsx` 与 `.xlsm` 工作簿而不改动它（工作表、区域、OOXML 部件、链接、受保护的宏内容、哈希、校验状态）。\n- 渲染工作表与指定区域为确定性 PNG，便于视觉检查格式与布局。\n- 通过受保护的提交流程（dry-run 规划 → `expectedSha256` 冲突检查 → 原子写入 → 提交后校验）编辑选中单元格与工作簿内容。\n- 对比两个工作簿的结构与内容，并在接受结果前校验其完整性。\n- 保留上游 `workbook-editor` skill（原样、未翻译），内置六把 `workbook_*` 工具与 `workbook-doctor` 诊断命令。"
    },
    {
      "section": "效果",
      "text": "- **Fail-closed**：任何无法以字节级保真处理的包（ZIP64、加密、共享/数组/数据表/溢流公式区域、不可变受保护部件）都会明确拒绝，而不是静默降级。\n- **可验证**：每次提交都要求 `expectedSha256`，写入后立即校验并支持与基线比对；就地编辑会先留恢复副本。\n- **不碰宏**：只清点、保留与校验 VBA 等受保护内容，从不执行或修改。\n- **可审计**：模型可见输出有上限，超出时完整 JSON 落到临时文件并给出路径，不截断信息。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "从本地目录安装（需要先自行构建）：\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/GongYuanCaiJi/dsh-extension-workbook.git\ncd dsh-extension-workbook && npm install        # 触发 prepare，产出 dist/\ndsh plugin --profile <profile> add ../dsh-extension-workbook\n```\n\n或直接通过 GitHub 安装：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:GongYuanCaiJi/dsh-extension-workbook\n```\n\n安装时会通过 `prepare` 脚本自动构建 `dist/`。若 pnpm 拦下构建步骤，在 profile 的 `pnpm-workspace.yaml` 里把本包加进 `allowBuilds`。\n\n本包尚未发布到 npm；需要 Node.js 24 或更新版本。安装后重启 dsh 让插件生效。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用",
      "text": "引用或给出 `.xlsx` / `.xlsm` 文件路径，然后描述你要的结果：\n\n> 检视这个工作簿，修正 Summary 表中的合计，保持格式不变，并展示校验结果。\n\n建议先 `workbook_inspect` 或 `workbook_render` 熟悉文件，审阅建议的单元格改动，最后比对与校验满意后再保留编辑后的文件。"
    },
    {
      "section": "移植说明",
      "text": "本插件是 [@firstpick/pi-extension-workbook](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@firstpick/pi-extension-workbook)（MIT）的 dsh 移植（port），上游代码按「100% 原样复制、只做必要适配」的规则保留；每一处适配都记录在 [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](./THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)。上游的文字（skill 与 docs）是英文而本项目受众以中文为主，按原样复制规则**未翻译**，保留原文。如果上游对你有帮助，[也给上游一个 star](https://github.com/Firstp1ck/pi-coding-agent-forge)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT。上游 [`@firstpick/pi-extension-workbook`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@firstpick/pi-extension-workbook) `Copyright (c) 2026 Firstpick`，本移植 `Copyright (c) 2026 GongYuanCaiJi`。见 [LICENSE](./LICENSE)。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "English",
      "text": "**Inspect, render, edit, diff, and validate Excel workbooks in DeepSeek Harness with a fail-closed, hash-guarded workflow: no macro execution, no external-data refresh, dry-run first, and every commit protected by SHA-256 conflict checks.**"
    },
    {
      "section": "English",
      "text": "This is a dsh port of the Pi extension [@firstpick/pi-extension-workbook](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@firstpick/pi-extension-workbook) (MIT) — see [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](./THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md) for the pinned upstream artifact and every adaptation. Please [star the upstream repo](https://github.com/Firstp1ck/pi-coding-agent-forge) too. The upstream skill and docs remain verbatim English (the port rule forbids translating them)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Inspects `.xlsx` and `.xlsm` workbooks without changing them.\n- Renders sheets and focused ranges to deterministic PNGs so formatting can be checked visually.\n- Edits selected cells and workbook content through a guarded workflow: dry-run planning, `expectedSha256` conflict protection, atomic writes, post-commit validation.\n- Diffs two workbooks by sheets, values, formulas, styles, part hashes, and protected content; validates structure before the result is accepted.\n- Ships the upstream `workbook-editor` skill, six `workbook_*` tools, and a `workbook-doctor` diagnostic command."
    },
    {
      "section": "What you get",
      "text": "- **Fail-closed**: packages the engine cannot process with byte-level fidelity (ZIP64, encrypted, shared/array/data-table/spill formula regions, immutable protected parts) are rejected loudly, never silently downgraded.\n- **Verifiable**: every commit requires `expectedSha256`; outputs are validated immediately and against an optional baseline; in-place edits keep a recovery copy.\n- **Macro-safe**: protected active content is inventoried, preserved, and verified — never executed or edited.\n- **Bounded output**: model-visible results are capped; oversized JSON is written to a temp artifact whose path is returned."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "From a local directory (build first):\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/GongYuanCaiJi/dsh-extension-workbook.git\ncd dsh-extension-workbook && npm install        # runs prepare, produces dist/\ndsh plugin --profile <profile> add ../dsh-extension-workbook\n```\n\nOr directly from GitHub:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:GongYuanCaiJi/dsh-extension-workbook\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "The `prepare` script builds `dist/` during install. If pnpm blocks the build step, add the package to `allowBuilds` in the profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml`.\n\nNot published to npm yet; requires Node.js 24+. Restart dsh after installing so the plugin loads."
    },
